WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.700 --> 00:00:04.370
Unit 1024. Foundations: the perception stack.

2
00:00:06.700 --> 00:00:10.800
A concept for a robot that takes the dull shift, right next to people.

3
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:19.330
To work next to people, a robot has to see, understand, and decide. Many times a second.

4
00:00:19.800 --> 00:00:23.960
Five layers, bottom to top. Sense. Map. Understand. Plan. Act.

5
00:00:27.200 --> 00:00:31.940
Every layer can say no. And safety runs beside the stack, never on top of it.

6
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:40.150
First, depth. Every point gets a distance. Close is warm, far is cool.

7
00:00:41.000 --> 00:00:44.760
Then things, with names. Racks, totes, and a person, tracked.

8
00:00:46.600 --> 00:00:49.870
Someone steps into the lane. It replans around them.

9
00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:56.890
Inside 3.2 m, it slows. Inside 1.6 m, it waits.

10
00:00:58.000 --> 00:00:59.960
One robot. Every angle.

11
00:01:05.700 --> 00:01:09.840
And every unit carries its own mark. One chevron. It never moves.

12
00:01:12.700 --> 00:01:15.520
Unit 1024. Takes the dull shift.

